# Simple square pyramid, no UVs/materials — just positions.
# Fits in the same -0.5..0.5 cube bounds as your existing test cube.
# No vn entries on purpose: aiProcess_GenSmoothNormals will compute them,
# which also doubles as a check that normal generation is working.

v -0.5 -0.5 -0.5
v  0.5 -0.5 -0.5
v  0.5 -0.5  0.5
v -0.5 -0.5  0.5
v  0.0  0.5  0.0

# base
f 1 2 3
f 1 3 4

# sides
f 2 1 5
f 3 2 5
f 4 3 5
f 1 4 5
